			"notes": "Minor update here for v3.1.1!\n\n- A new feature that allows you to copy a message in chat by clicking on the scissors\n- Added a few more hover-events for the messages you receive when you join the game\n- Fixed a lang bug with the kittycannon command under keybindings\n\nAs a notice I am in the process of re-designing my website so in the near future, you will need to update the mod to the latest version for it to work as the mod receives a lot of information through my site.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/skyguygamer/SkyBlock-Mod-Fabric/compare/v3.1...v3.1.1"
