			"notes": "Skyblock 1.19.2 is finally out! This version takes the changes and is the first full version of the mod ready to work with the new server!\nChangelogs\n- Wandering trader notifications\n- Vote party llama notifications\n- Sounds for alerts\n- Sneak speed added to leggings\n- New raffle instead of lottery added\n- Auto buy will stay in if you prefer it over the servers version\n- Staff list is now directly linked to Skyblock's API\n- Trident enchantments\n- Crossbow enchantments\n- Turtle helmet enchantments\n- Disabled clag features as its no longer a thing\n- Vote party toggle is fixed\n- Player voted toggle is fixed\n- Leaving crate messages and trade logs incase they come back\n- /sbmodfolda should work on linux/mac os now (Not the parameters though)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/skyguygamer/SkyBlock-Mod-Fabric/compare/v3.0.5...v3.1"
		},
