			"notes": "Skyblock Mod 3.0.4 is out now\nI will be switching to full releases but a bigger update will probably need to be made when the 1.19.2 version of the server comes out\n\n- Chat pm's and trades logged\n- Toggles in the menu make more sense\n- Fixed crashing bug on staff joins and leaves\n- Autobuy will now also register on the next lottery starting\n- Ability to toggle off some new things such as friends joining, players perishing in the void, and more! \n- Command that opens the sbmod folder\n- Added missing types of trades for logging\n- You will be notified in the welcome message if your version is out of date and there is a new latest release, if you have the latest one and it is still saying you don't have the latest, let me know on discord SkyGuyGamer#1251\n- Sponsoring /sponsor\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/skyguygamer/SkyBlock-Mod-Fabric/compare/v3.0.3.1...v3.0.4"
